  id: RiverRaftLanding
  displayName: Raft Landing
  description: A log slipway, bundles of reeds drying and a raft being lashed together.
    Trains Reed Rafts with a slinger aboard; its ferry seats 3. Build it on the shore
    of open water. Its boats patrol the water and shoot at raiders near the shore;
    send troops to land the water cuts off and its ferry carries them across.
